Scenario: Create and view team external link
	Koroneiki team external links created via API should be viewable via API.

	Given I create an account on koroneiki with the following values
	| Code                  | KORAUTO                                  | |
	| Contact Email Address | koroneiki.contact1@lrcustomer.com.broken | |
	| Description           | Test automotive account on koroneiki     | |
	| Fax Number            | 555-555-1234                             | |
	| Name                  | Koroneiki Automotive                     | |
	| Phone Number          | 555-555-5678                             | |
	| Profile Email Address | koroneiki.contact1@lrcustomer.com.broken | |
	| Region                | United States                            | |
	| Status                | Active                                   | |
	| Tier                  | T4                                       | |
	| Website               | www.koroneikiautomotive.com              | |
	And I create a team with the name "Development Team" for the account "Koroneiki Automotive"
	And I create an external link on a team "Development Team" with the following values
	| Domain      | devteam |
	| Entity Id   | 1234    |
	| Entity Name | DevTeam |
	And I create a nested field for the team external link with the following values
	| Domain      | devteam |
	| Entity Id   | 1234    |
	| Entity Name | DevTeam |
	Then I should be able to view a koroneiki team with the name "Development Team" with the external link nested field partial value "devteam"
	And the external link with the entity id "1234" should be present on the team "Development Team" with the following values
	| Domain      | devteam |
	| Entity Id   | 1234    |
	| Entity Name | DevTeam |
	And the external link with the entity id "1234" should be present on the team "Development Team" via the external link key with the following values
	| Domain      | devteam |
	| Entity Id   | 1234    |
	| Entity Name | DevTeam |
	And I should be able to view a koroneiki team with the name "Development Team" using the external link domain "devteam" and entity name "DevTeam" and entity id "1234"

